{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104069","id":2390942257,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6OguIx","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104069","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104069.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104069.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104069","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104069/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104069/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104069/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/5f4f2f9f5d72cf7333275f6465733c50bb1436d0","number":104069,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[DRAFT] Allow android/xr editor to begin gradle builds","user":{"login":"devloglogan","id":95497005,"node_id":"U_kgDOBbErLQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95497005?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan","html_url":"https://github.com/devloglogan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"*Edit 2025-04-23: Adding new setup instructions / comments to the top of PR description*\r\n\r\nThis PR is a proof of concept at this point, that with some minimal setup Godot can have termux install all the needed dependencies and then build an APK.  **Note: this process currently automatically accepts android SDK license agreements**, this is temporary and just for ease of testing.\r\n\r\nHere's some info on how to set it up if you'd like to give it a try, do note that on first run the build will take quite a while, at least five or six minutes for me on Quest 3. After an initial successful build, another build takes maybe around a minute.\r\n\r\n### Setup\r\n- Download the latest [Termux arm64 apk](https://github.com/termux/termux-app/releases/tag/v0.118.2) and install on your device (I've only tested this on Meta Quest 3)\r\n- Open up termux and run the command `termux-setup-storage`\r\n- Edit the `~/.termux/termux.properties` file and uncomment the line `allow-external-apps = true`\r\n- Grant the com.termux.permission.RUN_COMMAND permission to Godot with adb:\r\n```\r\nadb shell pm grant org.godotengine.editor.v4.meta.debug com.termux.permission.RUN_COMMAND\r\n```\r\n- Install the android build templates built from this branch, or you can just use the 4.4-stable build template and replace the `build.gradle` file by hand\r\n\r\nAfter that, it _should_ be able to execute a build, but I will not be surprised at all if I've missed something and people bump into issues.\r\n\r\n### Current Termux Command Flow on Build\r\n- Check if OpenJDK 17 is installed\r\n  - If not, install it with `pkg`\r\n- Check if all android sdk packages are installed with `sdkmanager`\r\n  - If this fails, it will run a gradle task to install `wget`, `unzip`, `sdkmanager`, and all the other android sdk stuff.\r\n- Check if aapt2 is installed\r\n  - If not, install it with `pkg`\r\n- Run a gradle build with an extra task added to find and replace any aapt2 files found in `~/.gradle`\r\n  - If it fails (and it will fail the first time ever attempted) it will attempt once more. This is just a hacky workaround for the time being. After that initial fail, aapt2 will be swapped and it shouldn't fail again.\r\n- Copy and rename the built file with gradle\r\n\r\n---\r\n*Edit 2025-04-23: Outdated initial PR description*\r\n\r\nAt the moment this PR is just for testing purposes. These changes allow android devices to install android build templates and then begin the gradle build process, staging the necessary files for a gradle build, but will exit before actually attempting the gradle build command.\r\n\r\nI've only tested with this patched to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/4c311cbee68c0b66ff8ebb8b0defdd9979dd2a41 on the XR Editor.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097562,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1NjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:android","name":"platform:android","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2909900850,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyOTA5OTAwODUw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:export","name":"topic:export","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-03-13T13:17:58Z","up